# The D2_LJ potential of ta_lj_cutdummy.tadah (the Tadah! 1.6.0 quickstart
# potential) with a Cut_PolyS switch. Cut_PolyS is only C^2 at its inner
# radius rc - 1 (the third derivative jumps there), and
# with this cutoff that junction, r = 8.00060436239767, lies at t = 0.95 of
# table segment 7280 (nr = 8192): next to a node, where the force error of
# the cubic Hermite table peaks in a narrow band between sparse check points.
ATOM     Ta
BIAS     false
DIMER     false     0     false
INIT2B     true
INITMB     false
LAMBDA     0
MODEL     M_KRR     Kern_Linear     1
NORM     false
OALGO     1
RCTYPE2B     Cut_PolyS
RCUT2B     9.00060436239767
TYPE2B     D2_LJ     Ta     Ta
WATOM     73
WEIGHTS     14.204213349318765225     2604.396965191186154698
